@startuml
title N05 - Node storage
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "N05\nNode storage" as N05
interface "NodeStore::append(); acknowledge(); oldest()" as API
database "Owned state\nbounded business-event deque and explicit gap-marker flag" as State
queue "Input / output\nBusiness DomainEvent + ACK → retained/released event or overflow signal" as IO
API --> N05
IO --> N05
N05 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
N05 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "N02\nNode radio" as N02
N05 ..> N02 : contract / port
note bottom of N05
Flow: Ignore periodic heartbeat for flash journal; deduplicate; append before transmit; retire on DURABLE or DISCARDED_POLICY; signal capacity loss.
Guard: Full store does not silently drop; gap_marker_required becomes true. Volatile ACK cannot delete business evidence.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
